/Title (Dekho bhai mene bola tha ki ye line jo blue color ki dikhai hein wo show honi hi nahi chahiye. Tumne kya banaya Scenes jaha likha hein uske left side mein ek extra button add kar diya. So jab bhi uss button ko click karte hein to pehle ye blue line show hoti hein fir iss blue line mein jo arrow left side mein dikh raha hein usko click karte hein to fir wo Scenes ka new panel shoe hota hein jo mene pink color mein dikhaya hein wo. Actually kya hona chahiye ki jab tumne Scenes likha hua hein uske left side mein jo button banaya hein usko click karne se directly hi ye Scene ka new panel khulna chahiye jo pink coclor ka mene dikhaya wo penel. ye blue coclor mein dikhai hui panel ko tum dele hi kardo bhai wo shoe kabhi bhi nahi honi chahiye.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Next 113 0 R
>>
